1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,170
Run !

25
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:07,690
Hold on tight !

26
00:02:09,040 --> 00:02:10,250
Help me !

27
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:11,570
Save me !

28
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,050
What is this ?

29
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:30,010
Senior Brother, what do we do !?

30
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,170
The Foreign Battlefield is collapsing !

31
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:34,050
Hurry to the teleportation formation !

32
00:02:53,240 --> 00:02:54,330
Ma Liang...

33
00:02:54,920 --> 00:02:57,450
War God Shrine disciple from the Burning Fire country...

34
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:59,170
Teleportation formation...

35
00:02:59,160 --> 00:03:00,570
I have 3 days...

36
00:03:02,560 --> 00:03:03,810
You’re courting death !

37
00:03:10,720 --> 00:03:12,130
So you guys

38
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,610
have also crossed the rift.

39
00:03:23,400 --> 00:03:24,410
Little brother,

40
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:26,890
I never thought you’d actually do it.

41
00:03:27,160 --> 00:03:28,570
Those two old fools

42
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:29,810
asked me to talk to you.

43
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,370
Since this space is collapsing,

44
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:32,810
what are your plans now ?

45
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:34,370
Will you stay here

46
00:03:34,120 --> 00:03:36,410
and devour this place with us ?

47
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:40,210
I'll use the teleportation formation to return to the mortal world.

48
00:03:39,960 --> 00:03:41,370
Th...that’s impossible !

49
00:03:41,120 --> 00:03:42,810
Newborn Soul Devourer,

50
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:44,930
there’s something you don’t understand.

51
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,610
The souls here

52
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:48,730
cannot leave this place.

53
00:03:49,240 --> 00:03:50,930
Cultivators stand no chance

54
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:53,810
against the power of the souls here.

55
00:03:53,560 --> 00:03:56,890
If wandering souls enter the mortal world,

56
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,930
they’ll be called devils

57
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:01,650
and bring a catastrophe to the world.

58
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:04,850
That is why the law of the world

59
00:04:04,600 --> 00:04:07,250
exists between the dead and the living.

60
00:04:07,280 --> 00:04:09,730
Any who dare to cross it

61
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,770
will be erased.

62
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:15,010
Then what is the Foreign Battlefield ?

63
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,770
This chaotic place

64
00:04:16,520 --> 00:04:19,210
was created by powerful beings of the mortal world

65
00:04:18,960 --> 00:04:22,090
and exists between life and death.

66
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:24,610
That's why

67
00:04:24,360 --> 00:04:26,890
Soul Devourers and wandering souls

68
00:04:26,640 --> 00:04:29,890
were only able to enter this place when it started collapsing.

69
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,890
Still,

70
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:32,690
you won't be able to leave.

71
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:35,050
Let alone those wandering souls.

72
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:37,490
As long as this place doesn’t fully collapse

73
00:04:37,240 --> 00:04:39,410
and I activate the teleportation formation,

74
00:04:39,160 --> 00:04:41,370
what will stop me from leaving ?

75
00:04:42,880 --> 00:04:43,930
Fine,

76
00:04:44,160 --> 00:04:45,370
since we are friends,

77
00:04:45,720 --> 00:04:48,530
I will try to slow down the collapse

78
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,610
but you can’t stop the wandering souls

79
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,890
from hunting.

80
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,610
One more thing.

81
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,410
I need your help.

82
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,010
We’ll be safe at the teleportation formation.

83
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:03,810
Keep going !

84
00:05:09,720 --> 00:05:11,930
Junior Brother Ma Liang never returned

85
00:05:11,680 --> 00:05:13,130
so he must be dead.

86
00:05:12,360 --> 00:05:14,650
Lin Tao
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

87
00:05:12,880 --> 00:05:14,130
We're out of luck,

88
00:05:13,880 --> 00:05:16,090
where did these monsters come from ?

89
00:05:16,480 --> 00:05:19,570
Yang Xiong
War God Shrine disciple
Late stage Foundation Establishment

90
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,810
Junior Brother Ma,

91
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,410
quick !

92
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,410
Everyone, I'm here,

93
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:21,090
wait for me !

94
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:24,010
Ma Liang...

95
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,130
I'm glad he's alive.

96
00:05:29,840 --> 00:05:31,130
This time,

97
00:05:30,880 --> 00:05:32,370
we’re done for !

98
00:05:35,880 --> 00:05:36,930
Scram !

99
00:05:40,000 --> 00:05:41,690
The heavens are in our favor,

100
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,290
they want me to survive !

101
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:44,090
Junior Sister,

102
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:47,090
I don’t know why those monsters stopped attacking us

103
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,730
but we can’t stay here.

104
00:05:49,160 --> 00:05:51,250
Let’s go to the teleportation formation

105
00:05:51,000 --> 00:05:53,010
so we can leave the Foreign Battlefield.

106
00:05:53,160 --> 00:05:54,210
Okay.

107
00:05:53,980 --> 00:05:56,250
Junior Brother Ma, stay close to us

108
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,610
since you're the weakest.

109
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,890
Stop wasting time.

110
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,610
If you're not going, I'll go.

111
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:03,330
Stay close and be careful.

112
00:06:03,440 --> 00:06:04,490
Okay.

113
00:06:04,440 --> 00:06:06,370
Now I understand why Ma Liang

114
00:06:06,120 --> 00:06:08,520
was grateful to Zhou Zihong in his memory.

115
00:06:08,270 --> 00:06:10,490
Since I’ve taken his body,

116
00:06:10,240 --> 00:06:12,330
I should fulfill some of his wishes

117
00:06:12,080 --> 00:06:13,970
even if I have other plans for these three.

118
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,050
Thank you, Senior Sister.

119
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,810
This body has no spiritual energy,

120
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,810
I'm driving it with my Divine Sense.

121
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:23,690
Once I leave the Foreign Battlefield,

122
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,890
I need to find a place to cultivate.

123
00:06:27,960 --> 00:06:32,090
2 days later

124
00:06:34,520 --> 00:06:37,490
Where is the teleportation formation ? I still don't see it.

125
00:06:37,680 --> 00:06:39,570
We chose the closest one to us.

126
00:06:39,560 --> 00:06:42,050
Don't you feel like

127
00:06:41,800 --> 00:06:44,490
the collapse has slowed down lately ?

128
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,770
Weird...

129
00:06:45,520 --> 00:06:48,330
Logically, it should be accelerating.

130
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,890
It’s been 2 days.

131
00:06:52,400 --> 00:06:54,530
They’re probably dead.

132
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:55,890
Keep looking.

133
00:06:56,360 --> 00:06:59,330
Ge Yang and Xu Hao know the real Ma Liang is dead

134
00:06:59,080 --> 00:07:00,890
so they must die.

135
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:03,450
The teleportation formation requires a token

136
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:06,250
but they also stole Ma Liang’s token.

137
00:07:06,720 --> 00:07:08,390
I'd like to find it if possible.

138
00:07:08,200 --> 00:07:09,690
If I can't find it,

139
00:07:09,680 --> 00:07:13,250
I’ll need to steal a token from my fellow sect members.

140
00:07:14,160 --> 00:07:16,730
You're really cunning for a Soul Devourer...

141
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,930
Alright,

142
00:07:17,680 --> 00:07:18,930
I’ll keep looking.

143
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:21,570
Zihong, be careful !

144
00:07:31,320 --> 00:07:33,330
There’s something wrong with Ma Liang.

145
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,450
Our smooth journey

146
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:35,570
is not a coincidence.

147
00:07:35,480 --> 00:07:37,410
Ever since Junior Brother Ma returned,

148
00:07:37,160 --> 00:07:39,890
these creatures stopped attacking us.

149
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,970
If you want to live

150
00:07:41,720 --> 00:07:43,450
don’t ask questions.

151
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:09,930
We found what you wanted.

152
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,650
Stop here.

153
00:08:12,880 --> 00:08:15,250
He can control the wandering souls !?

154
00:08:17,200 --> 00:08:19,130
According to the Soul Devourer,

155
00:08:19,240 --> 00:08:22,570
wandering souls are beings made of Divine Sense.

156
00:08:22,600 --> 00:08:25,050
They're driven by instinct to devour everything.

157
00:08:24,840 --> 00:08:27,570
But this soul's ethereal body is weird.

158
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,490
It looks like devouring so much Divine Sense

159
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,290
can leave traces.

160
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:34,210
It must have mutated.

161
00:08:34,160 --> 00:08:35,410
Kill him.

162
00:08:38,720 --> 00:08:40,210
I bear no grudge against Ma Liang.

163
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,450
Senior, please spare me !

164
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,570
I... I'm willing to become your slave.

165
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:44,730
Please spare my life !

166
00:08:45,280 --> 00:08:46,210
Stop.

167
00:08:50,600 --> 00:08:51,690
Senior,

168
00:08:51,430 --> 00:08:54,120
I would be honored to become your slave

169
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:56,570
and return safely to the Burning Fire country.

170
00:08:56,320 --> 00:09:00,490
Note: Lin Tao is giving his Soul Blood to Wang Lin here, he is willingly becoming a slave.

171
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,570
I’m not bloodthirsty by nature

172
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:05,770
but if you’re not smart...

173
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:08,090
I’ll have no choice but to be.

174
00:09:16,880 --> 00:09:19,010
Junior Sister, you...

175
00:09:19,040 --> 00:09:20,210
Senior,

176
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,650
I’ve been meaning to ask.

177
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:24,130
When you possessed Ma Liang,

178
00:09:24,640 --> 00:09:26,850
was he alive or dead ?

179
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,010
Dead.

180
00:09:42,360 --> 00:09:43,930
This wandering soul

181
00:09:43,680 --> 00:09:45,290
is now mine.

182
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:47,890
You sure don't hold back, do you ?

183
00:09:47,640 --> 00:09:48,690
Fine,

184
00:09:48,440 --> 00:09:49,890
you can have this wandering soul,

185
00:09:49,640 --> 00:09:51,130
if you like it.

186
00:09:50,880 --> 00:09:54,210
But I advise you to return to the Void with us.

187
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:56,490
This is the fate of a Soul Devourer.

188
00:09:56,680 --> 00:09:58,810
What if I insist on leaving ?

189
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:01,410
You three go first.

190
00:10:01,160 --> 00:10:03,370
Yes Master.

191
00:10:12,240 --> 00:10:13,890
Why are there so many monsters ?

192
00:10:13,640 --> 00:10:15,200
There are too many !

193
00:10:14,120 --> 00:10:16,090
When will the teleportation formation activate ?

194
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:17,690
This is terrifying, there're too many.

195
00:10:17,440 --> 00:10:18,290
Don’t worry,

196
00:10:18,040 --> 00:10:19,330
they can’t enter.

197
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:21,850
Junior Sister Li !

198
00:10:21,600 --> 00:10:23,210
Hurry, Junior Sister !

199
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:24,210
Go faster !

200
00:10:32,640 --> 00:10:33,850
We’re safe.

201
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:36,370
These wandering souls won’t touch the barrier.

202
00:10:34,440 --> 00:10:36,370
Why are there so many monsters ?

203
00:10:36,120 --> 00:10:37,450
As long as we stay inside

204
00:10:37,200 --> 00:10:38,490
they won’t dare to enter.

205
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:40,290
Can we really survive this ?

206
00:10:40,280 --> 00:10:41,570
Is this barrier

207
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:45,330
the law of the world separating the dead from the living ?

208
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:52,450
Almost there,

209
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,850
the formation is about to activate.

210
00:10:55,440 --> 00:10:56,850
Look over there,

211
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,610
there are 3 cultivators.

212
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:03,330
Why aren't the wandering souls attacking them ?

213
00:11:04,160 --> 00:11:05,930
What’s happening ?

214
00:11:08,400 --> 00:11:11,130
The monsters are making way for them !

215
00:11:22,040 --> 00:11:23,610
Why are the monsters killing themselves ?

216
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:25,330
Is someone’s controlling them ?

217
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:26,610
Little brother,

218
00:11:26,360 --> 00:11:27,650
it’s useless.

219
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:30,290
The teleportation formation is the entrance to the mortal world.

220
00:11:30,040 --> 00:11:32,090
Any soul that touches it

221
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:33,570
will be erased instantly.

222
00:11:38,440 --> 00:11:39,890
The monsters have gone mad,

223
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,690
they’re trying to break the barrier !

224
00:11:50,360 --> 00:11:51,970
These black threads

225
00:11:52,040 --> 00:11:54,770
must be the law of the world.

226
00:11:58,240 --> 00:11:59,810
Let's try this.

227
00:12:11,640 --> 00:12:14,090
They’ve all been erased.

228
00:12:14,160 --> 00:12:17,290
Let’s see how many it can stop.

229
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,650
You go.

230
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:46,490
No way !

231
00:12:46,240 --> 00:12:48,010
It’s broken through !

232
00:12:51,080 --> 00:12:52,290
Junior Brother !

233
00:12:59,160 --> 00:13:00,730
Could it be

234
00:13:00,480 --> 00:13:03,850
that my Divine Sense can briefly resist the law of the world ?

235
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,450
These black threads seem designed

236
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:15,650
to annihilate souls.

237
00:13:15,720 --> 00:13:17,690
The black threads are harmful to us,

238
00:13:17,440 --> 00:13:18,810
are you okay ?

239
00:13:19,040 --> 00:13:20,210
I'm okay.

240
00:13:20,640 --> 00:13:22,970
But if there are too many threads,

241
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,610
I'll be in trouble.

242
00:13:24,600 --> 00:13:27,490
Ge Yang and Xu Hao have looted people for 50 years,

243
00:13:27,880 --> 00:13:29,890
they must have good artifacts.

244
00:13:32,840 --> 00:13:36,370
This is perfect for the Turtle Shell Formation.

245
00:13:58,080 --> 00:13:59,250
It’s open !

246
00:13:59,160 --> 00:14:00,330
It’s open !

247
00:14:00,800 --> 00:14:02,330
It’s finally open !

248
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:04,330
Finally, we can leave this hellhole.

249
00:14:04,120 --> 00:14:05,650
Thank god !

250
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,930
I can finally leave.

251
00:14:10,080 --> 00:14:11,850
You three go first,

252
00:14:11,800 --> 00:14:13,370
wait for me outside.

253
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,530
Yes Master.

254
00:14:19,680 --> 00:14:20,530
Are you leaving ?

255
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,410
Yes.

256
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,050
Thank you

257
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:24,770
for everything you did.

258
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:33,210
I underestimated these black threads.

259
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:35,770
The moment it saw a powerful Soul Devourer,

260
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,610
it took the initiative to attack...

261
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:23,890
I have no choice but to endure.

262
00:15:32,520 --> 00:15:34,610
Is this the Ji Realm !?

263
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:41,570
I’ve already died once.

264
00:15:41,320 --> 00:15:42,650
This time,

265
00:15:42,400 --> 00:15:44,290
no one can stop me !

266
00:15:54,720 --> 00:15:56,890
Can he survive this ?

267
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:04,650
The law of the world

268
00:16:04,400 --> 00:16:07,650
is accidentally refining his soul with his Ji Realm.

269
00:16:11,880 --> 00:16:14,170
Law of the world...

270
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:16,450
Come at me !

271
00:16:31,880 --> 00:16:34,570
He really entered the mortal world...

272
00:16:34,320 --> 00:16:37,370
Will he still be a Soul Devourer out there ?

273
00:16:37,480 --> 00:16:39,970
His Soul Devourer essence will remain

274
00:16:39,880 --> 00:16:41,730
but his Divine Sense

275
00:16:41,480 --> 00:16:44,410
and his Ji Realm were merged by the law of the world.

276
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,730
That means,

277
00:16:45,480 --> 00:16:47,170
his Ji Realm Divine Sense

278
00:16:46,920 --> 00:16:48,290
will be able to

279
00:16:48,040 --> 00:16:50,850
annihilate cultivators of the same level instantly.

280
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:53,010
Teng Huayuan...

281
00:16:53,080 --> 00:16:55,250
I, Wang Lin, am coming back !

282
00:16:55,800 --> 00:16:58,770
You and your Teng Family will pay.

283
00:16:58,520 --> 00:17:00,770
Blood for blood.

284
00:17:03,370 --> 00:19:05,770
The Ji Realm was a very extraordinary realm. Normally, the Ji Realm comes from spiritual energy, however, Wang Lin currently didn’t have any spiritual energy, but his soul started to show signs of the Ji Realm.

[...] Wang Lin’s soul collapsed the moment the giant hand touched him, but the moment it collapsed, it was put back together by the mysterious Ji Realm and continued resisting.

[...] Each time, his Ji Realm got stronger, especially this time. Wang Lin’s soul charged toward the Ji Realm and was refined each time it was shattered. During this second, Wang Lin’s large soul underwent more than 10 000 reconstructions. His soul gradually shrunk and condensed, but its quality went through an earth shattering change.

The Ji Realm completely fused with his soul.

No one knows where the Ji Realm comes from, but it was certain that all of the cultivators that had the Ji Realm only had it in their spiritual energy. Only Wang Lin, through some fluke, had the Ji Realm imprinted to his soul.

In truth, the giant hand formed by the law of the world was the catalyst to allow Wang Lin’s soul to contain the power of the Ji Realm. After the Heaven Defying Bead fused with Wang Lin’s soul, there was a sliver of Ji Realm left in his soul. However, without these circumstances, once Wang Lin had regained his spiritual energy, this sliver of Ji Realm would've disappeared.

[...] If there was no law of the world and Wang Lin had tried to form his Ji Realm Divine Sense himself, he wouldn’t have been able to do it in his lifetime, but now it was complete.

285
00:17:09,190 --> 00:17:15,080
I've been walking this path for endless years

286
00:17:11,490 --> 00:17:15,080
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

287
00:17:15,470 --> 00:17:20,680
Is it the compass of fate

288
00:17:17,310 --> 00:17:20,680
that wrote this outcome for us ?

289
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:26,600
The heavens want to erase your existence,

290
00:17:26,470 --> 00:17:32,320
that's the obsession guiding me.

291
00:17:32,350 --> 00:17:37,920
Is this the path to uncover

292
00:17:34,230 --> 00:17:37,920
truths from falsehoods ?

293
00:17:37,950 --> 00:17:43,520
In a world of murk and shadow,

294
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:43,520
only the flame of truth can light the way.

295
00:17:43,310 --> 00:17:49,240
Look at them all,

296
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:49,240
being carried by the waves.

297
00:17:49,430 --> 00:17:53,880
Look at them all,

298
00:17:51,590 --> 00:17:53,880
being drowned.

299
00:17:53,710 --> 00:17:57,200
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

300
00:17:56,990 --> 00:18:00,280
I will let the world refine my soul.

301
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:05,840
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

302
00:18:01,850 --> 00:18:05,840
I will fight.

303
00:18:05,590 --> 00:18:08,960
I'll break through the abyss of despair

304
00:18:08,710 --> 00:18:12,000
to finally learn who I really am.

305
00:18:11,750 --> 00:18:17,360
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

306
00:18:13,630 --> 00:18:17,360
I embrace this obsession.

307
00:18:17,110 --> 00:18:20,320
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

308
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:23,120
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

309
00:18:22,870 --> 00:18:28,600
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

310
00:18:24,910 --> 00:18:28,600
I'll still fight.

311
00:18:28,550 --> 00:18:31,960
It's hard to avoid loneliness

312
00:18:31,710 --> 00:18:35,000
when you are above everyone else.

313
00:18:34,750 --> 00:18:40,680
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

314
00:18:37,070 --> 00:18:40,680
be afraid of a firefly ?
